    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "V2g8k3",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -220,
      "name": "Note A",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 180,
      "content": "A — Stacked sections\nCompact greeting hero, then Next up (4 session cards) → To do split by role → My courses cards.\n+ Closest to the plan, simplest to build, each block maps 1:1 to a component.\n− Long page; public courses pushed far down; todos split in two lists."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "UTe34",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -220,
      "name": "Note B",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 180,
      "content": "B — Brand hero kept, two columns\n'Start Hacking' hero stays (shorter); dashboard sits in its fade like today's sliders. One merged, date-sorted todo list with role filter + day-grouped agenda; compact course cards.\n+ Keeps brand feel, dense, one priority list for dual-role users.\n− Two-column layout needs a separate mobile stacking order."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "xam6f",
      "x": 3080,
      "y": -220,
      "name": "Note C",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 180,
      "content": "C — Organised by course\nNo photo hero. 14-day strip for sessions, certificate banner, then one card per course with its own todos + CTA; sorted by urgency.\n+ Mental model = 'my courses'; replaces both old sliders naturally.\n− Cross-course urgency less visible; day strip chips need abbreviations/tooltips."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "qQkvS",
      "x": 4620,
      "y": -220,
      "name": "Note D",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 180,
      "content": "D — Focus hero + tabs\nHero becomes personal: next session in huge brand type + 'Needs your attention' top 3. Tabs To do / Sessions / Courses; todos as action cards with a direct button.\n+ Strongest 'what now?' answer, most compact, clear CTAs.\n− Tabs hide sessions/courses by default; empty/quiet weeks need a fallback hero."
    },
