      "x": 6160,
      "y": -220,
      "name": "Note E",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 180,
      "content": "E — B layout + A greeting, offers and chats\nShort greeting + 'This week at opencampus' teaser in the hero. Row 1: todo list + agenda (open public events appear hollow with Register). Row 2: latest chat messages + my-courses list. Full-width 'Open now' band (featured event + offers with deadline chips) before the unchanged public sliders.\nChats need a new server-side function (bot reads recent messages from Course.matrixRoomId); the browser can't read the rooms directly."
